ight/cr_level\nviolation it refuses on an active tree while the ticket still stays absent\nfrom a default read afterwards. A boundary tested only by \"the happy path\nstill works\" is untested.\n\nstatus and board are read-only, and that is proved rather than intended:\nthe tree is hashed before and after both verbs run through the real command\nand tool dispatch paths, byte for byte. A reporting command that writes is\na trap, so the assertion is on the tree, not on the absence of a write\ncall.\n\nOne real collision found: the CLI verb `status` is on pkg/plugin's reserved\nword list. The verb is `summary`; the RPC and MCP method names stay\nliteral, so the wire contract is unchanged and only the human-facing word\nmoved.\n\nCoverage checked PER PACKAGE, not as a combined average -- plugins/pbd\n90.4%, internal/pews 90.1%. The combined-average mistake shipped a red gate\none ticket ago and is not repeated here.","timestamp":"2026-09-07T06:37:43Z","author":{"name":"Aric Camarata","email":"aric.camarata@gmail.com"},"committer":{"name":"Aric Camarata","email":"aric.camarata@gmail.com"}},"repository":{"id":1352289740,"node_id":"R_kgDOUJpNzA","name":"cascade","full_name":"acamarata/cascade","private":false,"owner":{"login":"acamarata","id":277910,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NzkxMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277910?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acamarata","html_url":"https://github.com/acamarata","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acamarata/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acamarata/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acamarata/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acamarata/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acamarata/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acamarata/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acamarata/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/u